      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1136201807,
      "text": "Wrightia pubescens is a species of small tree in the family Apocynaceae. Its distribution includes: Australia, southern China, Taiwan (introduced), Indonesia, New Guinea, Philippines and Indo-China. In Viet Nam, it may be called: lòng mức lông."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Mentaos",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mentaos",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29691107,
      "text": "Mentaos, Mentaok dan Bintaos adalah spesies pohon kecil dalam genus Apocynaceae. Penyebarannya meliputi: Australia, Tiongkok, Taiwan (diperkenalkan), Indonesia, Papua Nugini, Filipina dan Indochina. Di Vietnam disebut lòng mức lông."
    }
